  "bills": [],
  "timeline": [
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-12-11",
      "text": "The landfill official said he could probably get past tonnage information and the annual report for the commission.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "691MMXxgTX4",
        "ts": "1:12:32",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:08.719Z",
        "endTs": "1:13:02"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-12-11",
      "text": "He said the landfill's life estimate is based on average yearly tons, not on possible disaster debris.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "691MMXxgTX4",
        "ts": "1:11:30",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:08.719Z",
        "endTs": "1:12:16"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-12-11",
      "text": "He said disaster debris has to be handled in phases, such as building a temporary debris site before a permanent one.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "691MMXxgTX4",
        "ts": "1:08:50",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:08.719Z",
        "endTs": "1:09:20"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-12-11",
      "text": "The official said debris from even a medium-sized disaster probably would not fit in the landfill as it is now.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "691MMXxgTX4",
        "ts": "1:08:30",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:08.719Z",
        "endTs": "1:09:00"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-12-11",
      "text": "He said a medium-sized disaster would probably create more debris than the landfill could hold.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "691MMXxgTX4",
        "ts": "1:08:25",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:08.719Z",
        "endTs": "1:09:02"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-12-11",
      "text": "The chair said many older homes on the south shore may contain lead and arsenic and would need cleanup after a disaster.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "691MMXxgTX4",
        "ts": "1:07:45",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:08.719Z",
        "endTs": "1:08:38"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-12-11",
      "text": "He said the landfill cannot accept hazardous waste but can take some \"special waste\" under written handling rules.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "691MMXxgTX4",
        "ts": "0:51:07",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:08.719Z",
        "endTs": "0:51:47"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-11-13",
      "text": "Staff said that meeting may include a landfill update the commission asked for.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "tmMRZoYU2F0",
        "ts": "0:18:12",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:18.692Z",
        "endTs": "0:18:42"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-10-23",
      "text": "The motion to deny carried unanimously by a show of hands.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "KqjXsXpthgE",
        "ts": "0:42:12",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:35.805Z",
        "endTs": "0:42:42"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-10-23",
      "text": "The chair asked for verification that disposal at the landfill will not contaminate nearby surface water.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "KqjXsXpthgE",
        "ts": "0:36:17",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:35.805Z",
        "endTs": "0:36:53"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-10-23",
      "text": "The chair listed information the commission wants, starting with a disposal plan verified by Environmental Management for the landfill.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "KqjXsXpthgE",
        "ts": "0:35:41",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:35.805Z",
        "endTs": "0:36:11"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-10-23",
      "text": "A commissioner moved to deny the exemption, and another commissioner seconded.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "KqjXsXpthgE",
        "ts": "0:33:44",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:35.805Z",
        "endTs": "0:34:16"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-10-23",
      "text": "With a denial, the request would come back to the commission as an Special Management Area (SMA) minor permit.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "KqjXsXpthgE",
        "ts": "0:33:04",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:35.805Z",
        "endTs": "0:33:34"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-10-23",
      "text": "The planning department said it will try to do more outreach to Environmental Management on future demolition permits.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "KqjXsXpthgE",
        "ts": "0:14:45",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:35.805Z",
        "endTs": "0:15:30"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-10-23",
      "text": "Staff said the application was sent twice to the Department of Environmental Management with no response.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "KqjXsXpthgE",
        "ts": "0:12:11",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:35.805Z",
        "endTs": "0:12:45"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-10-23",
      "text": "The chair asked whether the landfill can safely take waste containing arsenic.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "KqjXsXpthgE",
        "ts": "0:11:03",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:35.805Z",
        "endTs": "0:11:42"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-10-23",
      "text": "Staff recommended granting the exemption.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "KqjXsXpthgE",
        "ts": "0:05:00",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:35.805Z",
        "endTs": "0:05:30"
      },
      "body": "Molokaʻi Planning Commission"
    }
  ],
